2111: sweetfb_hwtest=SECONDS draws a position chart instead of the frame for that long after the first frame, and logs the latched scaler, multirect and LM registers once. Default off. UNTESTED ON A PHONE, syntax-checked only.
Why: kern.sweet_fb_shot cannot read the canvas under sweetfb_ast_hw, so a phone photo is the only witness of the scan-out. Works with and without sweetfb_ast_hw so the two photos can be compared.
Apply: git apply after 2100, in any order with 2110, then rebuild the kernel. Host check: plans/hwscale/test/chart-check.c. Recovery: remove the boot-arg.

